    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Whether you're a fascinated outsider or a local proud of your nation's storied past, you're a devoted student of Osirion's history.\n\nYou might be a traveling professor, a member of a society like the Pathfinders or the Esoteric Order of the Palatine Eye, or even a simple tomb robber cashing in on the glories of the past.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Intelligence, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Occultism skill and the Ancient Osirion Lore skill. You gain the Oddity Identification skill feat."
    },
